{"id":1944,"date":"2015-05-29T12:22:14","date_gmt":"2015-05-29T11:22:14","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=1944"},"modified":"2015-05-29T15:28:54","modified_gmt":"2015-05-29T14:28:54","slug":"1944","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2015\/05\/29\/1944\/","title":{"rendered":"Le Dauphin, projet 1977"},"content":{"rendered":"<h1>Le Dauphin, sch\u00e9mas et documents techniques<\/h1>\n<h2>En 1976, le besoin pour un syst\u00e8me didactique pour enseigner les microprocesseurs \u00e9tait \u00e9vident. Le Dauphin a \u00e9t\u00e9 propos\u00e9 en janvier 1977 aux membres du Club d&rsquo;\u00e9lectronique, pour un prix de 270 CHF<\/h2>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"mediaobject\">\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<table class=\"mediaobject\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/www.smaky.ch\/thumb\/lami\/DauphinEcouteur.jpg\" alt=\"Dauphin 1977\" border=\"0\" \/><\/a><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"caption\">Dauphin 1977<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/td>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<table class=\"mediaobject\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/www.smaky.ch\/thumb\/lami\/DauphinGenial.jpg\" alt=\"Dauphin avec sa carte graphique\" border=\"0\" \/><\/a><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"caption\">Dauphin avec sa carte graphique<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<p><strong><a href=\"http:\/\/www.smaky.ch\/chapitre.php?id=lami_5\">Lien vers l&rsquo;article complet sur smaky.ch<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>Plans et montage, publi\u00e9 en Mai 1977 dans Eleclub, la revue du Club d\u2019\u00e9lectronique<br \/>\n<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/1977-05-Revue72-1-Syteme-Dauphin-Notice_de_montage.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">1977-05-Revue72-1-Syteme-Dauphin-Notice_de_montage.pdf<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/1977-05-Revue72-2-Syteme-Dauphin-Plaque_Microprocesseur.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">1977-05-Revue72-2-Syteme-Dauphin-Plaque_Microprocesseur.pdf<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/1977-05-Revue72-3-Syteme-Dauphin-Plaque_Memoire.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">1977-05-Revue72-3-Syteme-Dauphin-Plaque_Memoire.pdf<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/1977-05-Revue72-4-Syteme-Dauphin-Plaque_Clavier_Affichage.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">1977-05-Revue72-4-Syteme-Dauphin-Plaque_Clavier_Affichage.pdf<\/a><\/p>\n<h6>Merci \u00e0 Jean-Daniel Nicoud pour nous autoriser \u00e0 publier ces documents.<\/h6>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Le Dauphin, sch\u00e9mas et documents techniques En 1976, le besoin pour un syst\u00e8me didactique pour enseigner les microprocesseurs \u00e9tait \u00e9vident.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":37,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[249],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1944","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-projets"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1944","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/37"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1944"}],"version-history":[{"count":10,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1944\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1958,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1944\/revisions\/1958"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/micr